	(text "Output Impedance\nOUTPUT+ is 180 Ohms\nOUTPUT- is 250 Ohms\nDifferential is 430 Ohms"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 55.372 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "03dffdd9-e840-43a9-9f63-7c610f07e400")
	)
	(text "The two resistors set the\nopen loop gain\nG = 2.5 Per leg"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100.076 56.134 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2edf10fe-9854-4388-8ed0-462e22ec2141")
	)
	(text "Amplify Microphone output: 0.4Vrms (0.565685424949Vpeak)\n0.565685424949Vpeak*2 = 1.1313708499Vpp\nto 2.82Vpp with 2.5V DC\n2.82V/1.1313708499Vpp = 2.49255140368 Gain"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 171.958 139.954 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "31a376c6-c154-47fb-8fc3-fd832ad985b2")
	)
	(text "- DISABLE is asserted by applying a low\n- The DISABLE pin features an internal pull-up network that \n  enables the amplifier for normal operation. The ADA4940-1/ ADA4940-2 \n  DISABLE pin can be left floating (that is, no external connection is \n  required) and does not require an external pull-up resistor to ensure \n  normal on operation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 122.682 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3c349d2b-5cfe-4bd8-997e-145a93620413")
	)
	(text "1% Tolerance Resistors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 94.488 64.008 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4419bbc8-67bc-4499-9a70-3013d3822abd")
	)
	(text "Output DC Offset \nOUTPUT+ is 0.72V\nOUTPUT- is 0.66V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 74.93 59.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "730e6ff0-6a13-4bff-a936-1ca1a01534d2")
	)
	(text "Frequency Response from 20 Hz to 20 kHz"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 34.798 80.01 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "793e01f2-3642-4f25-b4b6-f220e5a71fe9")
	)
	(text "It is also possible to connect the VOCM input to a \ncommon-mode level (CML) output of an ADC. However, \ncare must be taken to ensure that the output has \nsufficient drive capability. The input impedance of \nthe VOCM pin is approximately 250 kΩ."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 164.084 72.136 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "da4fcaf4-4f00-4bf0-a2d7-a1d2ce354328")
	)
	(text "length-matched"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 93.218 70.104 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e26bdbfd-cbfc-4510-8455-55b8e1f7f492")
	)
	(text "Maximum Output Voltage\nSingle-Ended, 123 dB SPL input is 0.40V rms\nThis is Vpp≈1.13 V."
